{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人周慧敏近日被揭以2,499萬港元沽出一洋房，持貨16年，帳面淨賺299萬。</p><p>有地產資訊網站發現該單位位於東涌，實用面積約1,717呎，採3房間隔，連私人花園及天台，原本叫價2,650萬放盤，最後以2,499萬易手，平均呎價約14,554港</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T16:27:30.874086+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T16:01:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T16:20:45.983203+00:00","content_hash":"5a77536a0c31115c1347fff538baafe0e8128f52a060b85f8991e8fcb9ef0093","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}